Bravo, Kaiba, bravo.

262
00:14:46,500 --> 00:14:49,324
I knew nothing would stop
you from getting here.

263
00:14:50,100 --> 00:14:50,930
Pegasus.

264
00:14:56,560 --> 00:14:58,617
What do you mean there's another test?

265
00:14:58,700 --> 00:15:00,537
Yugi and I just beat you two in a duel.

266
00:15:00,620 --> 00:15:01,679
Isn't that enough?

267
00:15:01,860 --> 00:15:03,597
Enough to win our starships.

268
00:15:03,680 --> 00:15:06,100
But not enough to escape this labyrinth.

269
00:15:06,220 --> 00:15:08,514
You still must choose a door, remember?

270
00:15:09,000 --> 00:15:10,040
I remember.

271
00:15:10,540 --> 00:15:14,377
Now, which of you brothers are guarding
the door that leads out of here?

272
00:15:14,460 --> 00:15:17,440
If you cherish your lives,
you will choose my way.

273
00:15:17,840 --> 00:15:20,240
Select my side or else you'll pay.

274
00:15:22,100 --> 00:15:23,600
Not this game again.

275
00:15:24,020 --> 00:15:27,157
Can't you two just act normal and
give us a straight answer for once?

276
00:15:27,240 --> 00:15:29,240
I am giving you a straight answer.

277
00:15:29,340 --> 00:15:31,697
The answer is we can't
trust either of these two.

278
00:15:31,780 --> 00:15:32,900
Okay, guys.

279
00:15:33,120 --> 00:15:34,180
Any bright ideas?

280
00:15:34,540 --> 00:15:36,320
Uh, sure. Don't I always?

281
00:15:38,500 --> 00:15:39,540
Zero respect.

282
00:15:42,340 --> 00:15:43,900
We'll decide with these.

283
00:15:47,000 --> 00:15:48,480
Okay, heads or tails?

284
00:15:49,040 --> 00:15:49,870
Neither.

285
00:15:49,953 --> 00:15:52,357
I marked each coin to
represent a different door.

286
00:15:52,440 --> 00:15:56,777
The coin that I keep clenched in my fist
will be the door that I have chosen.

287
00:15:56,860 --> 00:15:57,720
Ah, Kaiba.

288
00:15:57,920 --> 00:15:59,677
I knew you'd come for Mokuba eventually.

289
00:15:59,760 --> 00:16:00,760
Oh, you did?

290
00:16:01,040 --> 00:16:02,637
Well, tell me something, Pegasus.

291
00:16:02,720 --> 00:16:07,367
Did you also foresee what I'm about to
do to you for harming my little brother?

292
00:16:07,700 --> 00:16:10,617
Actually, Kaiba, I predict
you won't lay a finger on me.

293
00:16:10,700 --> 00:16:11,760
And why is that?

294
00:16:16,300 --> 00:16:17,130
Ready?

295
00:16:28,980 --> 00:16:32,337
that coin is marked for
dox's door but was your

296
00:16:32,420 --> 00:16:36,617
choice good or was it poor
what say you dox shall we

297
00:16:36,700 --> 00:16:40,017
tell which was right in
due time para i'm enjoying

298
00:16:40,100 --> 00:16:43,097
their plight come on was
it para or Or was it Doc's?

299
00:16:43,180 --> 00:16:44,240
Yeah, fess up!

300
00:16:48,740 --> 00:16:49,697
I say...

301
00:16:49,780 --> 00:16:50,757
You choose wrong!

302
00:16:50,840 --> 00:16:52,940
It was my doorway! All along!

303
00:16:54,920 --> 00:16:57,880
So Doc's door was the
right one? Not quite.

304
00:16:58,460 --> 00:16:59,290
Huh?

305
00:16:59,373 --> 00:17:00,203
Oh, yes it was!

306
00:17:00,580 --> 00:17:04,217
Except if we had picked it, Para's
door would be the right one.

307
00:17:04,300 --> 00:17:07,720
You can change which door
leads to which path, can't you?

308
00:17:08,220 --> 00:17:10,137
Ensuring that we choose wrong.

309
00:17:10,220 --> 00:17:11,360
That's no fair.

310
00:17:11,640 --> 00:17:12,740
You guys cheated.

311
00:17:13,380 --> 00:17:16,380
Too bad too late you chose
a way, and that means...

312
00:17:16,780 --> 00:17:18,427
In this maze, you will stay.

313
00:17:18,680 --> 00:17:22,000
Well, actually, you never saw our choice.

314
00:17:22,980 --> 00:17:23,880
The Doc's coin.

315
00:17:25,280 --> 00:17:28,337
I figured the two of you
would pull a stunt like this,

316
00:17:28,420 --> 00:17:31,420
so I pulled a stunt of my
own with these two coins.

317
00:17:31,840 --> 00:17:34,677
Instead of marking them both
with just one door insignia,

318
00:17:34,760 --> 00:17:36,457
I marked the second coin with two.

319
00:17:36,540 --> 00:17:38,397
One insignia on each side.

320
00:17:38,480 --> 00:17:40,320
That way, we couldn't lose.

321
00:17:41,480 --> 00:17:43,009
Beat you at your own game.

322
00:17:43,360 --> 00:17:44,400
Both of them.

323
00:17:44,840 --> 00:17:48,781
Now, if you'll excuse us, we have
a score to settle with your boss.

324
00:17:49,520 --> 00:17:50,480
All right, then.

325
00:17:51,100 --> 00:17:52,920
On to Pegasus' castle.

326
00:17:55,440 --> 00:17:57,060
You conniving snake.

327
00:17:57,440 --> 00:18:01,205
I should take you down right now
for what you've done to Moguba.

328
00:18:01,680 --> 00:18:03,837
Don't be ridiculous, Kaiba boy.

329
00:18:03,920 --> 00:18:09,820
In my dungeon, in my castle, in my realm,
the only one who makes threats is me.

330
00:18:18,720 --> 00:18:19,550
Mokuba?

331
00:18:26,000 --> 00:18:26,960
You monster!

332
00:18:27,320 --> 00:18:28,277
What have you done?

333
00:18:28,360 --> 00:18:29,497
What have you done to him?

334
00:18:29,580 --> 00:18:31,497
It's just a little magic trick.

335
00:18:31,580 --> 00:18:33,860
Tell me, what have you done?

336
00:18:34,240 --> 00:18:37,237
I've ensured your
cooperation, for you see...

337
00:18:37,320 --> 00:18:41,732
Mokuba's soul is now imprisoned in a
place where the locks can't be picked.

338
00:18:42,100 --> 00:18:42,930
You're mad!

339
00:18:43,120 --> 00:18:48,100
And there he will remain, Kaiba boy, until
you beat me in a duel. Duel? With you?

340
00:18:48,300 --> 00:18:49,130
Now?

341
00:18:49,213 --> 00:18:50,373
Fine, I'll do anything!

342
00:18:51,620 --> 00:18:52,450
Mm-mm.

343
00:18:52,533 --> 00:18:53,363
Not just yet, Kaiba.

344
00:18:53,446 --> 00:18:55,677
You must first earn the
privilege to challenge me.

345
00:18:55,760 --> 00:18:58,878
And you can only do that by
defeating Yugi in a duel.

346
00:18:59,440 --> 00:19:04,940
And if you can't win against him,
Mokuba's soul will stay mine forever.
